<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996 aluminium output,demand hit record high.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996 aluminium output,demand hit record high.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese output and shipments of fabricated aluminium products rose to record highs in 1996, on robust demand in the beverage can, automobile and construction sectors, the Japan Aluminum Federation said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 1996 data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>			 1996	 yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	   2,495,330	+3.5 pct</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  1,244,780	+1.9 pct</p>
<p>   Extrusions   1,250,550	+5.1 pct</p>
<p> Shipments	2,486,496	+3.8 pct</p>
<p>   Flat-rolled  1,238,686	+2.2 pct</p>
<p>   Extrusions   1,247,810	+5.3 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
